# Casting a spell without paying its mana cost does not change its mana value (CR 118.9c, 202.3; Gaddock Teeg's ruling).
# Bot1's Show and Tell puts Omniscience onto the battlefield and Bot2 puts Gaddock Teeg beside it. Echo of Eons (mana value
# 6) may not be cast from Bot1's hand without paying its mana cost; Lodestone Golem (a creature, mana value 4) and Lightning
# Bolt (mana value 1) are cast that way - the Bolt for {1}, the Golem's tax on nonartifact spells, which the Island pays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Show and Tell
Omniscience
Echo of Eons
Lodestone Golem
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Gaddock Teeg
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Omniscience)
Bot2.Choose(Gaddock Teeg)
! Bot1.Hand.Echo of Eons.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Lodestone Golem.Cast(Ability: Without paying)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2; Ability: Without paying)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand = Echo of Eons
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Omniscience; Lodestone Golem
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield = Gaddock Teeg
Bot2.Life = 17
